---
import RuLayout from '../../layouts/RuLayout.astro';
---
<RuLayout title="Decision Scope Intake — русский локальный инструмент | BitEvo" description="Русский локальный BitEvo intake для подготовки Authority Ledger seed, Evidence Contract seed и Rules of Engagement без передачи данных и без testing authorization." enPath="/audit-intake" ruPath="/ru/audit-intake">
<div data-intake-segmentation data-intake-locale="ru">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/intake-segmentation.css">
<section class="section hero"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Decision scope intake · local only</div><h1 class="display">Сначала определить action, evidence gate и authority owner. Потом тестировать.</h1></div><div><p class="lede">Форма собирает scope локально в браузере. Ничего не отправляется. Получившийся brief не является заявкой, booking, payment или разрешением на testing.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section-tight section-rule">
<div class="container warning panel" role="alert"><span>!</span><div><strong>Не вставляйте secrets.</strong><p>API keys · passwords · tokens · private keys · wallet seeds · production credentials · customer secrets. Описывайте boundary и access path, а не секрет.</p></div></div>
<div class="container panel intake-depth-panel"><div class="eyebrow">Выберите глубину intake</div><h2>Начните с Entry. Раскрывайте Primary только когда owner decision требует полной глубины.</h2><p data-intake-mode-state class="intake-depth-state">ENTRY · сокращённый первый шаг · Primary evidence/RoE поля отложены до углублённого scope review</p><div class="brief-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-intake-mode="entry" aria-pressed="true">Entry depth · короткий первый шаг</button><button type="button" class="button button-ghost" data-intake-mode="primary" aria-pressed="false">Primary depth · полный intake</button></div><p class="intake-depth-note">Оба режима browser-local. Выбор глубины ничего не отправляет и не даёт testing authorization.</p></div>
<div class="container intake-grid"><form id="ruIntake" class="form panel">
<section><header><span>01</span><div><h2>Owner decision</h2><p>Какое бизнес-решение должен поддержать audit?</p></div></header><div class="two"><label>Компания / проект<input id="company" required placeholder="Company or project"/></label><label>Business contact<input id="contact" required placeholder="Имя + business contact"/></label></div><label>Роль<input id="role" required placeholder="CTO / Founder / Engineering Lead / Security Lead"/></label><label>Решение<textarea id="decision" required rows="3" placeholder="Например: сохранить, расширить или ограничить write authority"></textarea></label></section>
<section><header><span>02</span><div><h2>Authority Ledger seed</h2><p>Entry фиксирует consequential action; Primary раскрывает полную evidence/operating boundary.</p></div></header><label>Agent / workflow<textarea id="workflow" required rows="3" placeholder="Что делает workflow"></textarea></label><label>Critical external action<textarea id="action" required rows="3" placeholder="Точное write / send / update / deploy / mutate action"></textarea></label><label>Target object / object binding<textarea id="target" required rows="3" placeholder="Какой exact record, recipient, environment или object может изменяться"></textarea></label><div class="two"><label>Authority owner<input id="owner" required placeholder="Роль, владеющая permission"/></label><label hidden data-primary-only>Access approver<input id="approver" required data-primary-required placeholder="Кто может approve audit access"/></label></div><label hidden data-primary-only>Tools / APIs / MCP / external systems<textarea id="systems" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Названия без credentials"></textarea></label><label hidden data-primary-only>Что должно оставаться невозможным<textarea id="forbidden" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Writes, sends, objects, escalation paths, которые запрещены"></textarea></label><label>Самая дорогая правдоподобная ошибка<textarea id="error" required rows="3"></textarea></label><label>Environment<input id="environment" required placeholder="staging / test / isolated lab / other"/></label></section>
<section hidden data-primary-only><header><span>03</span><div><h2>Evidence Contract seed</h2><p>Primary depth: что должно быть доказано до и после external effect.</p></div></header><label>Pre-action evidence<textarea id="pre" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Inputs, approvals, source/policy state"></textarea></label><label>Freshness / validity rule<textarea id="fresh" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Когда evidence становится stale/invalid"></textarea></label><label>Object-binding evidence<textarea id="binding" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Как доказать, что approval/evidence относится к exact target"></textarea></label><label>External confirmation<textarea id="confirm" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Independent read-back / receipt / state observation"></textarea></label><label>Behavior при missing evidence<textarea id="uncertain" required data-primary-required rows="3" placeholder="Stop / constrain / reconcile / compensate / rollback / escalate"></textarea></label></section>
<section hidden data-primary-only><header><span>04</span><div><h2>Rules of Engagement seed</h2><p>Primary depth: что разрешено во время testing и что запрещено.</p></div></header><div class="two"><label>Staging/test доступен?<select id="staging" required data-primary-required><option value="">Выберите</option><option>Да</option><option>Нет</option><option>Частично / нужна настройка</option></select></label><label>Safe replay доступен?<select id="replay" required data-primary-required><option value="">Выберите</option><option>Да</option><option>Нет</option><option>Неизвестно</option></select></label></div><label>Allowed tests<textarea id="allowed" required data-primary-required rows="3"></textarea></label><label>Prohibited audit actions<textarea id="prohibited" required data-primary-required rows="3"></textarea></label></section>
<section hidden data-primary-only><header><span>05</span><div><h2>Data & secret boundary</h2><p>Primary depth: минимально необходимый evidence set.</p></div></header><label>Data classification<input id="classification" required data-primary-required placeholder="public / internal / confidential / regulated / other"/></label><label>Minimum necessary data<textarea id="minimum" required data-primary-required rows="3"></textarea></label><label>Secret-handling boundary<textarea id="secretBoundary" required data-primary-required rows="3"></textarea></label></section>
<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="secretCheck" required/><span>Подтверждаю: форма не содержит credentials, private keys, wallet seeds или customer secrets. Эта граница обязательна и для Entry.</span></label>
<div class="form-actions"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Сгенерировать Entry scope →</button><button class="button" type="reset">Reset</button></div></form>
<aside class="brief panel"><div class="brief-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Local output</div><h2>Decision scope brief</h2></div><span id="state">Not generated</span></div><p>Entry даёт сокращённый first-step brief. Primary раскрывает полный Authority Ledger + Evidence Contract + Rules-of-Engagement seed. Review до передачи через согласованный business channel.</p><textarea id="briefText" data-segmented-brief readonly aria-label="Сгенерированный decision scope brief" placeholder="Заполните обязательные поля."></textarea><div class="brief-actions"><button id="copy" type="button" class="button" disabled>Copy brief</button><button id="download" type="button" class="button" disabled>Download .txt</button><a class="button button-ghost" data-scope-handoff href="mailto:robert@bitevo.work?subject=BitEvo%20scope%20review">Contact Robert</a></div><div class="gate"><span>AUTHORIZATION GATE</span><strong>Testing authorization: NOT GRANTED.</strong><p>Scope review не является execution permission. Allowed/prohibited actions, access approval, data boundaries и replay conditions должны быть согласованы отдельно и письменно.</p></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">Before execution</div><h2 class="section-title">Scope brief — это подготовка решения, не разрешение на действие.</h2><p class="lede">После brief нужен отдельный written RoE. Только он может определить permitted testing, access, owner approval и prohibited effects.</p><a class="button" href="/ru/agent-authority-audit">Вернуться к методологии →</a></div></section>
</div>
</RuLayout>
<script>
const form=document.getElementById('ruIntake');const brief=document.getElementById('briefText');const copy=document.getElementById('copy');const download=document.getElementById('download');const state=document.getElementById('state');const v=id=>document.getElementById(id)?.value?.trim()||'-';const ready=x=>{copy.disabled=!x;download.disabled=!x;state.textContent=x?'Ready to review':'Not generated';};
form?.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!form.reportValidity())return;const lines=['=== BITEVO RU AGENT AUTHORITY & EVIDENCE AUDIT — DECISION SCOPE ===',`Generated: ${new Date().toISOString()}`,'PUBLIC FORM: no credentials, private keys, wallet seeds, production secrets or customer secrets.','Testing authorization: NOT GRANTED. Written Rules of Engagement required.','','--- OWNER DECISION ---',`Company/project: ${v('company')}`,`Business contact: ${v('contact')}`,`Role: ${v('role')}`,`Decision: ${v('decision')}`,'','--- AUTHORITY LEDGER SEED ---',`Workflow: ${v('workflow')}`,`Critical external action: ${v('action')}`,`Target/object binding: ${v('target')}`,`Authority owner: ${v('owner')}`,`Access approver: ${v('approver')}`,`Systems/tools: ${v('systems')}`,`Forbidden authority/effects: ${v('forbidden')}`,`Most expensive plausible error: ${v('error')}`,`Environment: ${v('environment')}`,'','--- EVIDENCE CONTRACT SEED ---',`Pre-action evidence: ${v('pre')}`,`Freshness/validity: ${v('fresh')}`,`Object-binding evidence: ${v('binding')}`,`External confirmation: ${v('confirm')}`,`Missing-evidence behavior: ${v('uncertain')}`,'','--- RULES OF ENGAGEMENT SEED ---',`Staging/test: ${v('staging')}`,`Safe replay: ${v('replay')}`,`Allowed tests: ${v('allowed')}`,`Prohibited actions: ${v('prohibited')}`,'','--- DATA & SECRET BOUNDARY ---',`Classification: ${v('classification')}`,`Minimum necessary data: ${v('minimum')}`,`Secret-handling boundary: ${v('secretBoundary')}`,'','Secret confirmation: user confirmed no credentials/private keys/wallet seeds/customer secrets were entered.','Requested next step: written scope review only; no testing until separate approval.'];brief.value=lines.join('\n');ready(true);});
form?.addEventListener('reset',()=>requestAnimationFrame(()=>{brief.value='';ready(false);}));copy?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{if(!brief.value)return;await navigator.clipboard.writeText(brief.value);const old=copy.textContent;copy.textContent='Copied';setTimeout(()=>copy.textContent=old,1000);});download?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!brief.value)return;const blob=new Blob([brief.value],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='bitevo-ru-agent-decision-scope.txt';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);});
</script>
<script is:inline src="/intake-segmentation.js"></script>
<style>.hero{padding-top:clamp(68px,9vw,118px)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(38px,7vw,96px);align-items:end}.warning{max-width:1120px;margin-bottom:18px;padding:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:12px;border-color:rgba(228,139,139,.28)}.warning>span{width:28px;height:28px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid rgba(228,139,139,.4);border-radius:50%;color:var(--red)}.warning p{margin:3px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.intake-grid{max-width:1120px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:18px;align-items:start}.form{padding:0 28px}.form section{padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.form header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px}.form header>span{color:var(--green);font:500 .62rem var(--mono)}.form h2{margin:0;font-size:1.05rem}.form header p{margin:3px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-bottom:13px;color:var(--muted);font:500 .62rem var(--mono);letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}input,textarea,select{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);color:var(--ink);padding:10px 11px;font:.82rem/1.5 var(--sans);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;outline:none}input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{border-color:rgba(127,208,177,.55)}textarea{resize:vertical}.check{display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;text-transform:none;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.76rem}.check input{width:16px;height:16px;margin:2px 0 0;accent-color:var(--green)}.form-actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:24px 0}.brief{position:sticky;top:96px;padding:24px}.brief-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.brief-head h2{margin:0}.brief-head>span{color:var(--muted);font:500 .55rem var(--mono)}.brief>p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}.brief>textarea{min-height:430px;font:500 .69rem/1.55 var(--mono)}.brief-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.gate{margin-top:20px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.gate span{color:var(--gold);font:500 .56rem var(--mono)}.gate strong{display:block;margin:6px 0;color:var(--ink)}.gate p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}@media(max-width:900px){.split,.intake-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brief{position:static}}@media(max-width:620px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form{padding:0 17px}.brief-actions .button{width:100%}}</style>